    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i really don't think it's that bad though. there isn't any blood and i don't feel dizzy or anything, just a bit of a dull ache. the er is so expensive and honestly kind of a hassle if i'm just gonna end up sitting there for hours when i feel mostly fine. are you sure i can't just take some advil and wait till morning to see if it gets better?",
